Unbiased population decomposition on known-truth prompts (truth = value of a reward-1 sample from either run; same prompt set for both runs).
right-rate = mean[k/8 + (8-k)/8 * 1(min-sample completed & value==truth)];  P(reward|right) = reward/right-rate
